This attempt tests an idea I cannot confirm in advance: shifting the plaintext mask instead of the ciphertexts. If `Plaintext` supports `>>` in the DSL, the result becomes S0·e0 + S1·e1 + S2·e2 with unit masks built from `first_slot`, and the two output-stage rotations disappear.

```cpp
void fhe()
{
